    "turn_text": "So I want to kick us off. I mean, first of all, your book was so interesting. Really enjoyed it. But, you know, there's a lot of buzz about this issue right now, especially where did wokeness come from? And so amidst all that buzz, you've kind of put your cards on the table, written this book about it. Why? What was it that you felt like was, you know, amongst what people were saying about it wasn't getting out there that you felt like people needed to know?",
