    "turn_text": "of the government comes in from above and can directly fix this. And I'm wondering if you can talk a little bit. I mean, we don't really have time to get deep into the details of every single one of the chapters in your book. But one of the things that's interesting to me about it is it is kind of an ecosystem. These things do kind of reinforce each other. And so I'm wondering when you think about these various issues, the newsroom versus universities versus science versus big tech, if you can talk a little bit about if there's some way in which fixing or at least making progress in one can help address the other issues.",
